sequenceDiagram
  participant API
  participant SB as ServiceBus
  participant DF as DurableFunction
  participant ACS
  participant Teams
  participant User

  API->>SB: Publish IncidentCreated
  SB->>DF: Start Orchestration
  DF->>ACS: Send initial notification
  DF->>Teams: Post Teams card

  alt Ack
    User->>Teams: ACK
    Teams->>API: ACK callback
    API->>DF: RaiseExternalEvent("ack")
  else Timeout
    DF->>ACS: Escalate
  end